# Our own 1H strikes on our own key poses (reports/Свои ключевые позы ударов.md, «Доводка») played with `ani`: the
# charged strike as T_1HCHARGEDEMO (windup, the 3-s hold loop and the release glued by finish_set.py: `ani` plays
# one clip, cannot start the loop S_1HCHARGE nor the release while the windup runs, and goes back to the stance
# instead of `next`; the game's logic chains the three), the shoulder
# barge T_1HBARGE and the riposte T_1HRIPOSTE. Without a talent overlay (the fixture's re-arm puts none on: animinfo
# logs the 20-frame S_1HRUN of HUMANS) from the side and from behind and above like the game's camera (`cam follow` angle 180 is behind the hero, 0 in front of him); then the
# charge and the barge at talent 2 (`bladepath HUMANS_1HST2.MDS` after the re-arm, its stance holds the sword up);
# Gothic's own T_1HATTACKL and S_1HATTACK from the side for the style; then slowed 4x from the side. Content from
# scripts/content/anim/finish_set.py (strikes-finish.json); the look is judged by Claude from the clips, anim_pop at
# the switches next to Gothic's own attacks. After a goto ~2 s on the ground before `ani`.
# WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN TIMEOUT=900 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=/abs/content
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
release all
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
wait 500
watch player
clear 3000
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 1500
animinfo S_1HRUN T_1HCHARGE S_1HCHARGE T_1HCHARGEHIT T_1HBARGE T_1HRIPOSTE

cam follow 420 120 270
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec charge-side
ani player T_1HCHARGEDEMO
wait 4800
stop

cam follow 380 170 180
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec charge-back
ani player T_1HCHARGEDEMO
wait 4800
stop

cam follow 420 120 270
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec barge-side
ani player T_1HBARGE
wait 1300
stop

cam follow 380 170 180
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec barge-back
ani player T_1HBARGE
wait 1300
stop

cam follow 420 120 270
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec riposte-side
ani player T_1HRIPOSTE
wait 2200
stop

cam follow 380 170 180
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec riposte-back
ani player T_1HRIPOSTE
wait 2200
stop

cam follow 420 120 270
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
bladepath HUMANS_1HST2.MDS
animinfo S_1HRUN
wait 2000
rec t2-charge-side
ani player T_1HCHARGEDEMO
wait 4800
stop

goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
bladepath HUMANS_1HST2.MDS
wait 2000
rec t2-barge-side
ani player T_1HBARGE
wait 1300
stop

goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec gothic-attack-side
ani player T_1HATTACKL
wait 1500
stop

goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec gothic-combo-side
ani player S_1HATTACK
wait 1800
stop

slowmo 4
cam follow 420 120 270
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec charge-slow
ani player T_1HCHARGEDEMO
wait 4800
stop

goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec barge-slow
ani player T_1HBARGE
wait 1300
stop

goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
melee-shadow weapon 1h
wait 2000
rec riposte-slow
ani player T_1HRIPOSTE
wait 2200
stop
slowmo 1
